  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to assist the Recipient in its efforts to improve the conditions for teaching and learning in its territory, through: (i) expanded access to education, (ii) enhanced quality of learning, and (iii) strengthened human resource management.</narrative>
